      "writtenOn": "2024-03-20T17:11:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah gotcha, and normally consecutive local matrix shaders are concatenated in the `SkLocalMatrixShader`, but because the SkImageShader isn\u0027t created until we\u0027ve already appended the picture shader\u0027s local matrix block, they don\u0027t get combined.",
      "parentUuid": "a37523ec_7f5d7c6a",
